I am not prepared to work.

8
00:00:44,913 --> 00:00:46,213
That's what I'm saying.

9
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:53,957
On the front end of the world,
I let you play this world.

10
00:00:54,040 --> 00:00:56,920
I let you do this time. Wow.

11
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:40,580
Oh, oh, oh.

12
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:58,637
I'm so proud of you I can't

13
