reach the power of my
heart. I can't eat with it.

14
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:05,893
I can't reach the beginning of the song.

15
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,620
I don't know how to get it.

16
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:17,460
I can't reach the end of my heart.

17
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:31,360
What it means to be strong, to be brave.

18
00:02:35,380 --> 00:02:40,600
I thought somehow I could
learn those things from Kirito.

19
00:02:44,540 --> 00:02:45,820
I don't want to die.

20
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:52,520
I don't know.

21
00:03:18,820 --> 00:03:20,660
A grenade!

22
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,150
A

23
